 function), labels: [[text, x, y]], onPick(x, y) }\n1209:- `shell.toast(title, text = '', seconds = 4)` †: a message that slides in at the top for a few seconds\n1210:- `shell.tutorial(title, text = '', seconds = 15)` †: a tutorial card (bottom left, dismissable) for some seconds; tutorial(null) takes it away\n1211:- `shell.root = null` †: game: the game it is over; o: its options; root: its DOM element (null in a headless game)\n1628:- `world.shellMap()`: the explored map for E.Shell's minimap: game.shell.hud({ minimap: world.shellMap() }) (a cell a square, the save and boss rooms marked, the hero's cell)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
