{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_74","type":"agent_message","text":"The expanded simulation suite passes all 23 checks. It caught a balance problem with the non-laser upgrade paths: the longer boss fight dealt too much incidental base damage. Both paths now win without cheats. I’m checking controller joins, touch cancellation, and Hub behavior under latency and packet loss.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_75","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'node tools/verify.mjs browser'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> docs/issues.md <<'EOF'\n| SF-07 | Major | Real browser's very short right-click landed and released between fixed updates, so held-only action sampling missed pulse. | Intent adapter now combines native pressed and down for fire, boost and pulse. |\n| SF-08 | Medium | Phone contact test placed a thumb in the lower letterbox and the adapter discarded it. | Invisible floating controls now accept the entire canvas; right-thumb drags supply a direction, including portrait letterbox space. |\n\nBrowser test maintenance: native Back icon and Back action have the same accessible name, so checks scope action selectors to the native action group. Pad press timing was changed to accommodate headless rendering cadence; that is not counted as a game defect.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> docs/issues.md <<'EOF'\n| SF-07 | Major | Real browser's very short right-click landed and released between fixed updates, so held-only action sampling missed pulse. | Intent adapter now combines native pressed and down for fire, boost and pulse. |\n| SF-08 | Medium | Phone contact test placed a thumb in the lower letterbox and the adapter discarded it. | Invisible floating controls now accept the entire canvas; right-thumb drags supply a direction, including portrait letterbox space. |\n\nBrowser test maintenance: native Back icon and Back action have the same accessible name, so checks scope action selectors to the native action group. Pad press timing was changed to accommodate headless rendering cadence; that is not counted as a game defect.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_75","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'node tools/verify.mjs browser'","aggregated_output":"FAIL browser: hover focus, keyboard activation and all factual credits pages\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261106-022731__x3f6200/work/Space-Fortnight-Space-Fortress-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-022731/tests/browser_checks.py\", line 20, in check\n    detail = fn()\n  File \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261106-022731__x3f6200/work/Space-Fortnight-Space-Fortress-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-022731/tests/browser_checks.py\", line 144, in credits_and_hover\n    need(page.locator('.esh-mod h2').inner_text()==label,'Credits section title wrong')\n    ~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261106-022731__x3f6200/work/Space-Fortnight-Space-Fortress-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-022731/tests/browser_checks.py\", line 27, in need\n    raise AssertionError(message)\nAssertionError: Credits section title wrong\n\nFAIL browser: four-pad join, independent pilots, pad-only pause/dev/sliders/reset/glyphs, reserved chord, drift and unplug\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261106-022731__x3f6200/work/Space-Fortnight-Space-Fortress-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-022731/tests/browser_checks.py\", line 20, in check\n    detail = fn()\n  File \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261106-022731__x3f6200/work/Space-Fortnight-Space-Fortress-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-022731/tests/browser_checks.py\", line 226, in controller\n    need(padpage.evaluate('__game.players.length')==4,'Four pad join failed')\n    ~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__2026110