06-022731/tests/browser_checks.py\", line 56, in focus_pad\n    raise AssertionError('Pad could not reach ' + label)\nAssertionError: Pad could not reach Thrust\n\n12 checks passed; 2 failed.\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
