{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_110","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('tests/browser_checks.py');s=p.read_text().replace('page.wait_for_timeout(40)\\\\n    page.locator(\\\".esh-ttl button\\\")', 'page.wait_for_timeout(40)\\\\n    page.wait_for_function(\\\"performance.now()>(__fortnight.blockInputUntil||0)\\\")\\\\n    page.locator(\\\".esh-ttl button\\\")');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('src/input.js');s=p.read_text().replace('const activity = (event) => {', '''const activity = (event) => {\n                if(event?.type === \\\"pointerdown\\\") this.game.input.lastDevice=event.pointerType === \\\"mouse\\\" ? \\\"mouse\\\" : \\\"touch\\\";''');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('src/ui/screens.js');s=p.read_text().replace('this.shell.backToTitle?.() || this.app.title();','this.app.title();').replace('online co-op runs through AI Hub.', 'online co-op runs through AI Hub. Ranks and scoring are original to this sortie.');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('src/render/scene.js');s=p.read_text().replace('px.rect(g, xx - 14, yy + 28, 28, 3, \\\"#1b3343\\\");', 'const reserveWidth = 28 + 14 * p.upgrades.boost;\\\\n                    px.rect(g, xx - 14, yy + 28, reserveWidth, 3, \\\"#1b3343\\\");').replace('(28 * p.energy) / p.maxEnergy','(reserveWidth * p.energy) / p.maxEnergy')\ns=s.replace('b.foe ? 3 : 3', 'b.foe ? 3 : b.dmg > s.balance.laserDamage * 1.1 ? 4 : 3')\ns=s.replace('if (s.modified) txt(g, \\\"MODIFIED RUN\\\",', 'if (s.modified) txt(g, \\\"MODIFIED RUN\\\",')\n# Add reserve information beside the existing compact badges without new controls.\ns=s.replace('if (p.hp <= 0)\\\\n', 'if (p.hp <= 0)\\\\n')\nneedle='''\t\t\t\t\t\ttxt(\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tg,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tp.pulse <= 0 ? \\\"PULSE READY\\\"'''\ns=s.replace(needle, '''                        txt(g,\"'`BOOST ${Math.ceil(p.energy)}/${p.maxEnergy}`,x+153,516,C.muted,1);\n'\"''' +needle)\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> docs/issues.md <<'EOF'\n| SF-11 | Medium | Boss screenshot showed the tutorial panel covering the newly docked player. | Moved desktop guidance to a compact side panel clear of the initial wing positions and shortened its display. Portrait uses separate letterbox space. |\n| SF-12 | Medium | Results screenshot clipped the second navigation action at the initial scroll position. | Reduced results spacing and put both actions on one row at TV sizes, retaining controller scrolling on smaller screens. |\n| SF-13 | Major | Touch attract-exit regression found a generated click could activate a newly revealed title button. | Added a short click-capture quarantine matching the existing input consumption window. Keyboard, pointer, pad and touch exits are checked. |\n\nAdditional implementation review fixes, excluded from the testing issue count: per-pad meaningful-activity states now reset on release; held meaningful sticks prevent idle; menu gestures update native prompt device; entry selection checks every co-op pilot; fortress anchors are kept clear of the opaque armor. The new safe-entry regression also checks those invariants.\nEOF\nbiome check --write --linter-enabled=false --assist-enabled=false src tools/*.mjs tests/simulation.mjs package.json\nruff check tests/browser_checks.py tools/*.py\nruff format tests/browser_checks.py tools/*.py\nnpm run build\nnode tools/verify.mjs browser\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
